{
  "name": "core",
  "vars": {
    "pane_id": "wE:p1",
    "workspace_id": "wE",
    "target": {
      "server_session_id": "primary",
      "pane_id": "wE:p1",
      "terminal_id": "term-1",
      "generation": 0,
      "agent_session_id": ""
    }
  },
  "compare": {
    "drop_types": [
      "e2ee_server_hello",
      "action_receipt"
    ],
    "unordered_types": [
      "push_config",
      "herdr_status",
      "workspaces",
      "agents",
      "activity_history",
      "inventory_status",
      "capabilities",
      "update_status",
      "speech_voices",
      "agent_profiles",
      "push_policy",
      "activity"
    ],
    "drop_keys": [
      "_server_received_at",
      "_server_sequence",
      "at",
      "id",
      "created_at",
      "updated_at",
      "paired_at_ms",
      "last_seen_at_ms",
      "expires_at_ms",
      "started_at",
      "completed_at",
      "timestamp",
      "ts",
      "idle_since",
      "last_active_at",
      "last_attempt_at",
      "last_success_at",
      "received_at_ms",
      "content_fingerprint",
      "last_seen_at",
      "target"
    ],
    "type_drop_keys": {
      "push_config": [
        "agent_profiles",
        "app_deploy",
        "capabilities",
        "herdr_status",
        "home",
        "host",
        "inventory",
        "speech_languages",
        "update",
        "vapid_public_key",
        "version",
        "release_version",
        "revision"
      ],
      "herdr_status": [
        "features",
        "generation",
        "surface_interest",
        "capabilities"
      ],
      "agents": [
        "pane_revision",
        "tokens",
        "state_labels"
      ],
      "workspaces": [
        "cwd",
        "tokens",
        "worktree"
      ]
    },
    "map_keys": [
      "device_id",
      "credential_id",
      "credential_secret",
      "vapid_public_key",
      "host",
      "home",
      "version",
      "release_version",
      "revision",
      "machine_id",
      "instance_id",
      "socket_path",
      "endpoint",
      "public_key",
      "proof",
      "nonce",
      "url"
    ],
    "async_dedupe": true,
    "notes": [
      "action_receipt is Rust's v3 dispatch-evidence addition \u2014 Go has no counterpart; dropped (census still shows it).",
      "inventory_status compares the full six-key projection (state/error_code/message/stale + both timestamps); last_attempt_at/last_success_at are wall-clock volatile.",
      "push_config is compared on {type,protocol} only \u2014 capability lists, update/inventory/speech blocks are implementation-scoped.",
      "agents/workspaces compare the common projection core plus server_session_id, activity_seq, project, raw_pane_id and the tab fields \u2014 all emitted identically by both relays. Still dropped: pane_revision (commit-epoch counter; its value depends on which internal commit the publish raced), tokens/state_labels (Go-only fields Rust does not project), and workspaces' cwd/tokens/worktree (Go hydrates cwd from tabs/panes; Rust omits it).",
      "herdr_status compares health_check/server_protocol/server_version; per-probe feature maps and generation counters are per-implementation.",
      "pane_content compares the full semantic projection for real \u2014 attention_kind/prompt/command/options/no_echo land from the shared classify+noecho pass.",
      "Go pushes an empty activity_history at connect; drop_matches removes only the null-activities variant.",
      "Go orders the startup burst push_config,agents,workspaces,activity_history,inventory_status; Rust sends push_config,herdr_status,workspaces,agents \u2014 unordered_types covers the interleaving."
    ],
    "drop_matches": [
      {
        "type": "activity_history",
        "contains": {
          "activities": null
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "expect",
      "label": "startup-push-config",
      "match": {
        "type": "push_config"
      },
      "timeout_ms": 8000
    },
    {
      "op": "expect",
      "label": "startup-workspaces",
      "match": {
        "type": "workspaces",
        "contains": {
          "workspaces": [
            {
              "workspace_id": "{workspace_id}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "expect",
      "label": "startup-agents",
      "match": {
        "type": "agents",
        "contains": {
          "agents": [
            {
              "pane_id": "{pane_id}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "settle",
      "label": "startup-settle",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "fence",
      "label": "startup-done"
    },
    {
      "op": "send",
      "label": "list-directories",
      "request_id": "req-dirs",
      "frame": {
        "type": "list_directories",
        "protocol": 3,
        "request_id": "{request_id}",
        "path": ""
      },
      "until": {
        "type": "command_result",
        "request_id": "{request_id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "send",
      "label": "worktree-list",
      "request_id": "req-wt",
      "frame": {
        "type": "worktree_list",
        "protocol": 3,
        "request_id": "{request_id}",
        "workspace_id": "{workspace_id}"
      },
      "until": {
        "type": "command_result",
        "request_id": "{request_id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "send",
      "label": "push-policy-get",
      "request_id": "req-pp",
      "frame": {
        "type": "push_policy_get",
        "protocol": 3,
        "request_id": "{request_id}"
      },
      "capture": [
        "push_policy"
      ],
      "until": {
        "type": "push_policy"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "send",
      "label": "send-input-text",
      "request_id": "req-si",
      "frame": {
        "type": "send_input",
        "protocol": 3,
        "request_id": "{request_id}",
        "pane_id": "{pane_id}",
        "text": "echo shadow\n",
        "target": "{target}"
      },
      "until": {
        "type": "command_result",
        "request_id": "{request_id}",
        "contains": {
          "phase": "completed"
        }
      },
      "timeout_ms": 10000
    },
    {
      "op": "send",
      "label": "send-input-keys",
      "request_id": "req-sk",
      "frame": {
        "type": "send_input",
        "protocol": 3,
        "request_id": "{request_id}",
        "pane_id": "{pane_id}",
        "keys": [
          "Enter"
        ],
        "target": "{target}"
      },
      "until": {
        "type": "command_result",
        "request_id": "{request_id}",
        "contains": {
          "phase": "completed"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "send",
      "label": "send-text",
      "request_id": "req-st",
      "frame": {
        "type": "send_text",
        "protocol": 3,
        "request_id": "{request_id}",
        "pane_id": "{pane_id}",
        "text": "echo shadow text\n",
        "target": "{target}"
      },
      "until": {
        "type": "command_result",
        "request_id": "{request_id}",
        "contains": {
          "phase": "completed"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "send",
      "label": "send-keys",
      "request_id": "req-keys",
      "frame": {
        "type": "send_keys",
        "protocol": 3,
        "request_id": "{request_id}",
        "pane_id": "{pane_id}",
        "keys": [
          "ctrl+c"
        ],
        "target": "{target}"
      },
      "until": {
        "type": "command_result",
        "request_id": "{request_id}",
        "contains": {
          "phase": "completed"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "send",
      "label": "read-pane",
      "request_id": "req-rp",
      "frame": {
        "type": "read_pane",
        "protocol": 3,
        "request_id": "{request_id}",
        "pane_id": "{pane_id}",
        "lines": 30,
        "format": "text",
        "target": "{target}"
      },
      "capture": [
        "pane_content",
        "pane_unchanged"
      ],
      "until": {
        "type": "pane_content"
      },
      "timeout_ms": 10000
    },
    {
      "op": "send",
      "label": "get-activity",
      "request_id": "req-ga",
      "frame": {
        "type": "get_activity",
        "protocol": 3,
        "request_id": "{request_id}",
        "limit": 50
      },
      "capture": [
        "activity_history"
      ],
      "until": {
        "type": "activity_history"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "send",
      "label": "unknown-action",
      "request_id": "req-zz",
      "frame": {
        "type": "zz_no_such_action",
        "protocol": 3,
        "request_id": "{request_id}"
      },
      "timeout_ms": 2500,
      "quiesce_ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "collect",
      "label": "drain",
      "timeout_ms": 2000,
      "quiesce_ms": 500
    }
  ]
}
